---
import { getEntry } from 'astro:content';
import Configurator from '../components/Configurator';
const product = await getEntry('products', 'xspi');
if (!product) throw new Error('Required product missing');
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head><meta charset="utf-8" /><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" /><meta name="description" content="Configure SLL xSPI-MC IP for your FPGA platform. Review licence eligibility and engineering support." /><link rel="canonical" href="https://shop.xspi.pro/" /><title>{product.data.title} — Configure your licence</title></head>
  <body>
    <header><a href="/" aria-label="SLL xSPI-MC home">SLL<span>xSPI-MC</span></a><span>FPGA IP / ENGINEERING</span></header>
    <main><section class="intro"><p class="eyebrow">BUILT FOR YOUR FPGA</p><h1>One IP. Your platform.<br /><em>Your configuration.</em></h1><p>Configure your xSPI-MC licence for your FPGA families, development team and production needs.</p><p class="included">Encrypted RTL <span> / </span> User manual <span> / </span> Reference design <span> / </span> Licence key</p><p>Tell us which board or kit you will use. An applicable approved standard R&amp;D/support offer can cover a board still being designed. Initial approved R&amp;D materials may precede the promised later reference design; detailed engineering information is collected privately when needed.</p><p class="preview">Local product preview · commercial approvals pending</p></section>
      <noscript><section><h2>FPGA families and licence options</h2><p><a href="/purchase/simple/">Use the Django configuration form without JavaScript</a>. Purchase remains unavailable.</p>{product.data.vendors.map(v => <div><h3>{v.label}</h3><ul>{v.families.map(f => <li>{f.label}</li>)}</ul></div>)}<p>R&amp;D annual and perpetual terms apply to all vendors. Yearly RDP is Altera-only: 1–100, 101–1,000, 1,001–5,000 units; above 5,000 requires a quotation. All pricing and final terms await approval.</p></section></noscript>
      <Configurator client:load />
      <p><a href="/support/">Explore 10-hour engineering support packages →</a></p>
      <section class="details"><h2>Rights that match your order.</h2><p>One vendor and one configured IP licence per line. Annual duration, renewal and expiry effects require agreed terms. Perpetual rights do not imply unlimited production, maintenance, updates or engineering support.</p><p>Host identifiers and business details are collected only through protected workflows. Delivery, compatibility and policies remain subject to approval.</p></section>
    </main><footer><span>SLL / xSPI-MC</span><span>shop.xspi.pro</span></footer>
  </body>
</html>
<style is:global>
:root{font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;color:#132f31;background:#f6f5ef;font-synthesis:none}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0}header,main,footer{max-width:1180px;margin:auto;padding:28px 36px}header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;border-bottom:1px solid #d5ddd5}header a{font-size:26px;font-weight:800;color:inherit;text-decoration:none}header a span{font-size:16px;margin-left:14px;font-weight:500}header>span,.eyebrow{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.15em;font-weight:700}a:focus-visible,input:focus-visible,select:focus-visible,button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #ad5e2f;outline-offset:4px}.intro{padding:46px 0 38px}.intro h1{font-size:clamp(36px,5.7vw,66px);line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-.045em;margin:18px 0 24px}.intro em{font-style:normal;color:#527867}.intro>p:not(.eyebrow){max-width:650px;line-height:1.7}.included{font-size:13px}.included span{color:#81978d;padding:0 8px}.preview{font-size:12px;color:#74502c}.configurator{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.5fr) minmax(280px,1fr);gap:40px;align-items:start}fieldset{border:0;border-top:1px solid #cad5cb;padding:26px 0 30px;margin:0}legend{font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;font-weight:700;padding:0 16px 0 0}label{display:block;font-size:14px;margin:14px 0 8px}select,input[type=number],#board-name{display:block;padding:12px;border:1px solid #a7b9ae;border-radius:5px;background:#fff;color:#132f31;font:inherit;width:100%;margin-top:8px}input[type=number]{max-width:210px}input[type=checkbox],input[type=radio]{width:18px;height:18px;accent-color:#275b4a;flex-shrink:0}.choice{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:5px 0}.families{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:0 18px}.families p{grid-column:1/-1;font-size:14px}.hint{font-size:12px;line-height:1.7;color:#52665d}.summary{background:#e5ecdf;border:1px solid #c9d7c2;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;position:sticky;top:24px}.summary h2{font-size:26px;letter-spacing:-.025em;margin:12px 0 26px}.summary dl{font-size:13px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:95px 1fr;gap:15px 12px}.summary dt{color:#52665d}.summary dd{margin:0;font-weight:600;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.summary p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.65}.summary .eyebrow{font-size:10px}.validation{padding:20px 0 8px;border-top:1px solid #bacdb5;margin-top:24px;font-size:13px}.validation ul{padding-left:20px;line-height:1.8}.summary button{width:100%;padding:15px;border:1px solid #a5b49f;border-radius:5px;background:#d5dfcf;color:#53664e;font-weight:700;cursor:not-allowed}.notice{font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;background:#eaece3;padding:18px}.details{margin-top:38px;border-top:1px solid #cad5cb;padding:28px 0;max-width:740px}.details h2{font-size:28px}.details p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;color:#52665d}.customer-drafts{border-top:1px solid #bacdb5;margin-top:24px;padding-top:16px}.customer-drafts input{display:block;width:100%;padding:12px;border:1px solid #a7b9ae;border-radius:5px}.customer-drafts button{margin:8px 0}.customer-drafts button:enabled{background:#275b4a;color:#fff;cursor:pointer}.customer-drafts ul{padding:0;list-style:none}footer{border-top:1px solid #cad5cb;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12px;color:#52665d}@media(max-width:760px){header,main,footer{padding:22px}.configurator{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px}.summary{position:static}header>span{display:none}.families{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
